{"seq":2,"slug":"differentiable-reasoning","title":"可微分推理与软逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neuro-symbolic-ai/architectures/differentiable-reasoning","wordCount":1800,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"可微分推理与软逻辑\">可微分推理与软逻辑</h1><p>逻辑推理天生与梯度下降不合：一条规则的真值是 0 或 1，导数处处为零，反向传播无从下手。整个神经符号架构家族的共同主线，就是想方设法绕开这道障碍——把离散的逻辑「松弛」成连续的、可导的形式，让梯度得以穿过推理过程。<a href=\"logic-tensor-networks\">逻辑张量网络</a> 是这条主线上的一个具体实例；本篇把镜头拉远，系统讲清这个家族的全貌：有哪几种松弛、各自怎么算、取舍何在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「软逻辑」指任何把布尔真值松弛为连续值的逻辑系统。松弛主要走两条路，对应 <a href=\"../foundations/symbolic-reasoning\">符号推理与知识表示</a> 里区分过的两种不确定性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[离散逻辑&lt;br/&gt;真值为 0 或 1 不可微] --&gt; B{如何松弛}&#10;    B --&gt; C[模糊松弛&lt;br/&gt;真值取 0 到 1 表程度]&#10;    B --&gt; D[概率松弛&lt;br/&gt;赋概率表可能性]&#10;    C --&gt; E[t范数实现连接词&lt;br/&gt;逻辑张量网络]&#10;    D --&gt; F[加权模型计数 WMC&lt;br/&gt;DeepProbLog 语义损失]&#10;    E --&gt; G[端到端可微&lt;br/&gt;梯度穿过逻辑]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[与神经网络联合训练]\">flowchart TD\n    A[离散逻辑&lt;br/&gt;真值为 0 或 1 不可微] --&gt; B{如何松弛}\n    B --&gt; C[模糊松弛&lt;br/&gt;真值取 0 到 1 表程度]\n    B --&gt; D[概率松弛&lt;br/&gt;赋概率表可能性]\n    C --&gt; E[t范数实现连接词&lt;br/&gt;逻辑张量网络]\n    D --&gt; F[加权模型计数 WMC&lt;br/&gt;DeepProbLog 语义损失]\n    E --&gt; G[端到端可微&lt;br/&gt;梯度穿过逻辑]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[与神经网络联合训练]</pre><p><strong>模糊松弛</strong>把真值解释为「有多真」的程度，用 t-范数实现连接词——这是逻辑张量网络的路线。<strong>概率松弛</strong>把真值解释为「为真的概率」，用概率论组合，核心运算是<strong>加权模型计数</strong>（Weighted Model Counting，WMC）：对一个逻辑公式，把所有使它为真的世界的概率加总。WMC 是 DeepProbLog、语义损失等概率神经符号系统的共同数学引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"概率一脉-deepproblog-与神经谓词\">概率一脉：DeepProbLog 与神经谓词</h2><p>DeepProbLog 由 Manhaeve 等人提出，是概率松弛的代表。它的关键创新是<strong>神经谓词</strong>（neural predicate）：在概率逻辑程序 ProbLog 的基础上，允许某些事实的概率由神经网络输出。</p>\n<p>经典示例是「两位手写数字相加」：输入两张 MNIST 图片和它们的和，标注只给出和（如 8），不给每张图的具体数字。DeepProbLog 用一个神经网络把图片映射为各数字的概率分布（神经谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>digit</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>img</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{digit}(\\text{img}, d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">digit</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">img</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），再用一条逻辑规则 <code>addition(A,B,S) :- digit(A,X), digit(B,Y), S is X+Y</code> 把它们组合。训练时，目标是最大化「观测到的和」这个查询的概率，梯度通过 WMC 反传回神经网络——网络在从未见过单张图标签的情况下，仅凭「和正确」这个弱信号，学会了识别单个数字。</p>\n<p>这正体现了概率松弛的威力：逻辑规则把弱监督信号「路由」到正确的神经参数上。其代价是 WMC 在最坏情况下是 #P-难的，公式一复杂，精确推理成本爆炸——这是概率一脉最核心的扩展性瓶颈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语义损失-把约束变成一个可加项\">语义损失：把约束变成一个可加项</h2><p>如果不想重写整个推理为概率程序，而只想给已有神经网络加一条逻辑约束，<strong>语义损失</strong>（Semantic Loss，Xu 等人 2018）提供了轻量方案。给定一个布尔约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 和网络输出的各变量概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，语义损失定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo>⊨</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><munder><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_s(\\alpha, p) \\propto -\\log \\sum_{\\mathbf{x} \\models \\alpha} \\prod_{i: x_i=1} p_i \\prod_{i: x_i=0} (1 - p_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5653em;vertical-align:-1.5153em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathbf mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5153em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3778em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3778em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>括号里正是约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为真的概率（一次 WMC）。最小化这个损失，等价于推动网络把概率质量集中到满足约束的输出上。它可以直接作为一个附加损失项加到任何分类任务里，例如强制「输出恰好一个类别为真」「路径必须连通」等结构约束。语义损失是 <a href=\"../reasoning/knowledge-injection\">知识注入与约束</a> 里「损失层注入」的典型工具，本篇负责讲清它背后的 WMC 机制，那一篇负责讲它与架构层、解码层注入的工程对比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类松弛的取舍对照\">三类松弛的取舍对照</h2><p>把这个家族里的代表方法并排比较，取舍一目了然。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>松弛类型</th>\n<th>核心运算</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逻辑张量网络</td>\n<td>模糊</td>\n<td>t-范数聚合</td>\n<td>直观、可表达程度</td>\n<td>t-范数选择敏感、量词成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepProbLog</td>\n<td>概率</td>\n<td>加权模型计数</td>\n<td>语义严格、弱监督强</td>\n<td>WMC #P-难、扩展性差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义损失</td>\n<td>概率</td>\n<td>加权模型计数</td>\n<td>轻量、可附加到任意网络</td>\n<td>仅约束输出、复杂约束昂贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模糊放松的可微 SAT</td>\n<td>模糊</td>\n<td>连续 SAT 目标</td>\n<td>可解组合问题</td>\n<td>易陷局部最优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择的关键问题是：你要的是「程度」还是「可能性」？要的是「严格语义保证」还是「工程上能加进现有训练」？需要表达不确定性、且能承受推理成本时选概率一脉；只想给现有网络打一条软约束、追求简单时选语义损失或 LTN。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可微推理与离散符号的根本张力\">可微推理与离散符号的根本张力</h2><p>退一步看，整个软逻辑家族都在做同一件事：用连续近似换取可微性。这带来一个本质张力——松弛得越软，越容易优化但越偏离原始逻辑语义；越接近硬逻辑，语义越精确但梯度越难用。所有方法都在这条谱线上选了不同位置。</p>\n<p>而这也解释了为什么会有一条截然不同的技术路线：与其辛苦地把离散逻辑松弛成连续，不如干脆让神经网络去<strong>生成离散的符号产物本身</strong>，用执行结果而非可微性来闭合学习。那就是 <a href=\"neural-program-synthesis\">神经程序合成</a> 的思路，它从根本上回避了本篇讨论的全部松弛难题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><p>这条主线上有几个反复出现的理解偏差。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>误以为松弛是免费的。用连续近似换可微性，就意味着训练目标与原始逻辑语义之间存在系统性偏差，松弛得越软偏差越大。</li>\n<li>把模糊松弛与概率松弛当成同一件事。前者用 t-范数聚合程度，后者用 WMC 组合可能性；混用会得到语义错误的目标函数。</li>\n<li>认为 DeepProbLog 的弱监督是「无监督」。它仍需要观测信号（如「和正确」），只是不需要符号级标签；信号缺失时回路闭合不了。</li>\n<li>把 WMC 当成普通可微分算子。它最坏是 #P-难的，公式一复杂精确推理成本爆炸，这是概率一脉扩展性瓶颈的根源。</li>\n<li>以为语义损失能表达任意复杂约束。它只约束输出层的概率质量分布，深层结构约束或需要内部状态参与的约束表达不了，也照样昂贵。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可微分推理家族的共同主线是「松弛」：把 0/1 的离散真值变成连续可导值，让梯度穿过逻辑。</li>\n<li>两条路线——模糊松弛（程度，t-范数，逻辑张量网络）与概率松弛（可能性，加权模型计数 WMC，DeepProbLog/语义损失）。</li>\n<li>DeepProbLog 的神经谓词能仅凭「和正确」这类弱信号学会识别单张图，体现逻辑把弱监督路由到正确参数的威力；代价是 WMC 的 #P-难。</li>\n<li>语义损失是轻量方案，把约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为真的概率（一次 WMC）取负对数作为可加损失项，是损失层知识注入的典型工具。</li>\n<li>根本张力：越软越好优化但越偏离逻辑语义；这也催生了完全回避松弛的另一条路——让神经直接生成可执行程序。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可微分推理与软逻辑","id":"可微分推理与软逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"概率一脉：DeepProbLog 与神经谓词","id":"概率一脉-deepproblog-与神经谓词"},{"level":2,"text":"语义损失：把约束变成一个可加项","id":"语义损失-把约束变成一个可加项"},{"level":2,"text":"三类松弛的取舍对照","id":"三类松弛的取舍对照"},{"level":2,"text":"可微推理与离散符号的根本张力","id":"可微推理与离散符号的根本张力"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"逻辑张量网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neuro-symbolic-ai/architectures/logic-tensor-networks"},"next":{"title":"神经程序合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neuro-symbolic-ai/architectures/neural-program-synthesis"}}